# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
# Re-include the dashboard's frontend `lib/` directory — without
# this negation, the generic `lib/` pattern above silently swallows
# `web/lib/{api,cn}.ts` + `web/lib/types/*.ts` (the TypeScript
# mirrors of the Python charter). Symptom: tests pass locally, fail
# in CI with FileNotFoundError on the TS files. Discovered after
# PR #125 CI 26448572653.
!web/lib/

parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

